bility* is the bedrock of intellectual merit. An SDK that ensures every prototype run is logged without manual effort directly supports scientific rigor and allows researchers to pivot quickly without fearing they've lost the \"paper trail\" required by law (and good science).\n\n    *   Rationale: Automating traceability during the prototyping phase protects research velocity and ensures that experimental results are reproducible and compliant without distracting from core intellectual work.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 85-90 (High, because it removes a significant friction point for researchers).",
