al explicitly frames itself as a research project for publications and intellectual merit.\n\n    *   The primary objective is to meet the legal requirement of Article 12 (which is prescriptive: log X, Y, Z).\n    *   Spending scarce implementation resources on \"formalizing trade-offs\" and \"researching frontiers\" for publication purposes does not directly solve the engineering problem of implementing a compliant logging system.\n    *   Moreover, the tension between DP (Differential Privacy) and strict auditability (Traceability) might make this technically non-viable as a compliance solution; an auditor cannot verify a specific event if it's been perturbed by noise for privacy reasons.",
