rectly addresses Article 12(1) \"automatic recording\" and Article 12(3) specific fields (timestamps, databases, input hashes/data, identities).\n    *   *Implementation Cost:* While it requires an initial investment from platform engineering, the long-term payoff is a reduction in per-project compliance overhead.\n\n    *   The proposal is highly viable. It leverages existing software patterns to solve a cross-cutting concern (compliance logging), which is exactly what middleware is for.\n    *   It improves prototyping speed by abstracting away regulatory boilerplate.\n    *   It ensures quality through standardization.",
