rd web technologies. => 3\n\nacceptability_evidence: Making logs customer-accessible is unusual for internal R&D but does not violate legal norms given anonymization and consent controls. => 3\n\napplicability_evidence: It directly addresses the mandate to technically allow automatic recording of Article 12 events and provides traceability for post-market monitoring. => 4\n\neffectiveness_evidence: If implemented, the API would satisfy the logging and traceability requirements and create competitive advantage as claimed. => 4\n\nReturn JSON? Instructions: echo id exactly. For each subscale give <subscale>_evidence then <subscale>. Probably output list.\n\nProvide rating.\n\nLet's produce final.",
